{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107577","id":2594313511,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6aohUn","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107577","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107577.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107577.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107577","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107577/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107577/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107577/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e298783a854a31824a6a110f3ae527130134deea","number":107577,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"C# - Add remaining disposer optimizations for Variant","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm not sure if I'm missing something, but this seems like it could be an easy optimization for C#.\r\n\r\nIf you run the following code:\r\n```cs\r\nVariant Vector3Variant = new Vector3();\r\nGD.Print(Vector3Variant.GetType().GetField(\"_disposer\", System.Reflection.BindingFlags.Instance | System.Reflection.BindingFlags.NonPublic)!.GetValue(Vector3Variant));\r\nVariant BasisVariant = new Basis();\r\nGD.Print(BasisVariant.GetType().GetField(\"_disposer\", System.Reflection.BindingFlags.Instance | System.Reflection.BindingFlags.NonPublic)!.GetValue(BasisVariant));\r\n```\r\nIt outputs:\r\n```cs\r\nnull\r\nGodot.Variant+Disposer\r\n```\r\n\r\nEven though `Basis` is a struct implemented directly in C# without a native reference, it is registered for disposing.\r\n\r\nIt seems like `Basis` is one of five structs (`Projection`, `Aabb`, `Basis`, `Transform2D`, `Transform3D`) that are eligible for bypassing disposing but don't.\r\n\r\nLet me know if there's something I'm missing about these structs!","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-16T03:17:31Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T21:07:25Z","closed_at":"2025-06-16T19:10:12Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ce4e586c7202d09e4f2024816c4424d1743a5a03","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Joy-less:add-variant-non-dis